SellerDashboardController ..> ClientModel
RegisterController ..> ClientModel

note bottom of P_SERVICE
  4 SINGLETON service (Bill-Pugh holder).
  Mọi state global đi qua đây.
  ConcurrentHashMap + CopyOnWriteArrayList
  cho thread-safety.
end note

note bottom of P_SERVER
  1 Thread / client (ClientHandler).
  ServerMain accept loop ở main thread.
  Push event qua AuctionObserver chain.
end note

