note right of Auction
  THREAD-SAFE CORE
  - placeBid()/extend()/transitionTo()
    được bao bởi ReentrantLock.
  - Notify observer NGOÀI lock
    → tránh deadlock + không block
       các bid khác khi observer chậm.
  - lock & observers là transient,
    readObject() khôi phục lại.
end note

note right of AuctionManager
  Scheduler 1 daemon thread:
    tickLifecycle() mỗi 1s
  PENDING→RUNNING→FINISHED→PAID
  internalObserver:
    + anti-sniping
    + forward global observers
end note

note right of BidManager
  inAutoBid : ThreadLocal<Boolean>
    chặn re-entry trong cùng thread
    (auto-bid trigger auto-bid → storm)
  placeBid() flow:
    1. validate bidder
    2. user.tryReserve() (atomic)
    3. auction.placeBid() (entity lock)
    4. release reservation cho leader cũ
    5. recordBid + tryTriggerAutoBids
end note

