' --- EVENT/PUSH FLOW (note) ---
note right of ClientHandler
  THREAD MODEL
  - 1 ClientHandler / 1 socket (mỗi connection 1 Thread)
  - send() là synchronized
    → tránh interleave giữa:
        a) trả response cho request hiện tại
        b) push do observer callback (thread khác)
  - cleanup() gọi eventManager.unsubscribeAll(this)
    → tránh memory leak khi client disconnect
end note

note right of AuctionEventManager
  REALTIME PUSH PIPELINE
  Auction.placeBid()      [worker thread của ClientHandler X]
   └─> notifyBidPlaced     (NGOÀI lock)
        └─> AuctionManager.internalObserver
              └─> globalObservers
                    └─> AuctionEventManager.onBidPlaced
                          └─> for each subscriber (ClientHandler Y, Z, ...)
                                └─> handler.send(JSON push)   [synchronized]
end note

note right of ClientModel
  CLIENT THREAD MODEL
  - ServerConnection chạy listenerThread (daemon)
    đọc từng dòng JSON, gọi onMessage()
  - handleServerMessage() route:
      isPush()  → dispatchPush() (BID_UPDATE, AUCTION_STATUS...)
      ELSE      → push vào responseQueues[action]
  - JavaFX controller gọi waitForResponse() trên thread phụ,
    sau đó Platform.runLater() update UI.
end note

