title Auction (zoom-deep) — state, lock & event flow

class Auction <<Entity>> {
  .. immutable ..
  - {final} itemId : UUID
  - {final} sellerId : UUID
  - {final} startTime : LocalDateTime
  - {final} startingPrice : BigDecimal
  - {final} minimumIncrement : BigDecimal
  .. mutable (lock-protected) ..
  - endTime : LocalDateTime
  - currentPrice : BigDecimal
  - highestBidderId : UUID
  - status : AuctionStatus
  - totalBids : int
  .. transient (re-init in readObject) ..
  - <<transient>> lock : ReentrantLock
  - <<transient>> observers : CopyOnWriteArrayList<AuctionObserver>
  .. constructors ..
  + Auction(itemId, sellerId, start, end, price, inc)
  + Auction(id, createdAt, updatedAt, ...)
  .. read-only queries ..
  + isActive() : boolean
  + getRemainingSeconds() : long
  + minNextBid() : BigDecimal
  + isInSnipingWindow(sec : int) : boolean
  .. mutation (LOCKED) ..
  + placeBid(bid : BidTransaction) : BidOutcome
  + extend(seconds : int) : void
  + transitionTo(s : AuctionStatus) : void
  .. observer mgmt ..
  + addObserver(o : AuctionObserver) : void
  + removeObserver(o : AuctionObserver) : void
  - notifyBidPlaced(b : BidTransaction)
  - notifyAuctionExtended(sec : int)
  - notifyStatusChanged(old, new)
  .. serialization ..
  - readObject(in : ObjectInputStream)
}

class "Auction.BidOutcome" as BidOutcome <<DTO>> {
  + {final} previousBidderId : UUID
  + {final} previousAmount : BigDecimal
}
Auction +-- BidOutcome

class BidTransaction <<Entity>> {
  - {final} auctionId : UUID
  - {final} bidderId : UUID
  - {final} bidAmount : BigDecimal
  - status : BidStatus
  + markValid() / reject() / markOutbid() / cancel()
}

interface AuctionObserver <<Observer>> {
  + onBidPlaced(a, b)
  + onAuctionExtended(a, sec)
  + onStatusChanged(a, old, new)
}

enum AuctionStatus <<Enum>> {
  PENDING --> RUNNING
  RUNNING --> FINISHED / CANCELED
  FINISHED --> PAID / CANCELED
  PAID, CANCELED  (terminal)
  + canTransitionTo(next) : boolean
  + isTerminal() : boolean
}

class BidManager <<Singleton>> {
  + placeBid(auctionId, userId, amount) : BidTransaction
}

class AuctionManager <<Singleton>> {
  - scheduler : ScheduledExecutorService
  - internalObserver : AuctionObserver
  + createAuction(...) : Auction
  + closeAuction(id, actor) : Auction
  - tickLifecycle() : void
  - trySettle(a : Auction) : void
}

class User <<Entity>> {
  + <<synchronized>> tryReserve(amt) : boolean
  + <<synchronized>> release(amt) : void
  + <<synchronized>> addRevenue(amt) : void
}

' --- relationships ---
Auction "1" *-- "0..*" AuctionObserver : observers (CoW)
Auction ..> BidOutcome : returns
Auction ..> BidTransaction : mutate(status)
Auction "1" o-- "1" AuctionStatus : status

BidManager ..> Auction : placeBid(bid) [enters lock]
BidManager ..> User : tryReserve / release [synchronized]
AuctionManager ..> Auction : transitionTo, extend [enters lock]
AuctionManager ..> User : addRevenue (in trySettle)
AuctionManager .|> AuctionObserver : internalObserver (anti-sniping + forward)

' ============= NOTES =============

note top of Auction
  CRITICAL SECTION = Auction.lock (ReentrantLock)
  Mọi method mutate state đều mua lock này.
  Read-only (isActive, getCurrentPrice…) KHÔNG lock
   → đọc lúc đang ghi có thể thấy "stale" tích tắc,
      nhưng KHÔNG inconsistent (BigDecimal immutable,
      reference assignment atomic theo JLS §17.7).
end note

note as N_placeBid
  **Auction.placeBid()** — LUỒNG (ATOMIC trong lock):
  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ 1. requireNonNull + assert auctionId match  │
  │ 2. lock.lock()                              │
  │ 3.   if !isActive()  → bid.reject()         │
  │                       throw AuctionClosed   │
  │ 4.   if bidder == seller → reject + throw   │
  │ 5.   if amount < minNextBid → reject + throw│
  │ 6.   SNAPSHOT prev leader / prev amount     │
  │ 7.   currentPrice = bid.amount              │
  │      highestBidderId = bid.bidderId         │
  │      totalBids++                            │
  │      bid.markValid()                        │
  │      markUpdated()                          │
  │ 8. lock.unlock()  (finally)                 │
  │ 9. notifyBidPlaced(bid)  ← NGOÀI LOCK       │
  │ 10. return BidOutcome(prev…)                │
  └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  Tại sao snapshot prev TRONG lock?
   → ngoài lock có thể bị bid khác overwrite,
      caller (BidManager) cần đúng leader cũ
      để release reservation.
end note
N_placeBid .. Auction

note as N_transition
  **Auction.transitionTo()** — STATE MACHINE
  (validate qua AuctionStatus.canTransitionTo):
        ┌──► RUNNING ─┐
  PENDING            ├─► FINISHED ──► PAID
        └─────────────┴─► CANCELED (terminal)
  - PAID & CANCELED không có outgoing.
  - Throw IllegalAuctionStateException nếu transition sai.
  - oldStatus snapshot trong lock → notify ngoài lock.
end note
N_transition .. Auction

note as N_extend
  **Auction.extend()** — ANTI-SNIPING:
  - Gọi bởi AuctionManager.internalObserver.onBidPlaced
    khi auction.isInSnipingWindow(threshold).
  - Lock RE-ENTRANT: cùng thread đang trong notify
    (đã ra khỏi lock placeBid) → reacquire OK.
end note
N_extend .. Auction

note right of AuctionObserver
  CHUỖI OBSERVER (mỗi event):
   Auction.notifyXxx (ngoài lock)
    └─> AuctionManager.internalObserver
         ├─ anti-sniping: auction.extend()
         └─ globalObservers.forEach
              ├─> BidManager (status watcher → tắt auto-bid)
              └─> AuctionEventManager
                    └─> ClientHandler[i].send(JSON push)
                         (synchronized I/O — risk chậm)
  Mỗi nấc đều safeNotify try-catch:
    observer crash KHÔNG vỡ chain.
end note

note as N_tick
  **AuctionManager.tickLifecycle()** — SCHEDULER:
  scheduleAtFixedRate(this::tickLifecycle, 1s, 1s)
  - daemon thread "AuctionManager-Scheduler"
  - Mỗi tick quét toàn bộ auctions:
      PENDING + (now >= start)        → transitionTo(RUNNING)
      RUNNING + (now >= end)          → transitionTo(FINISHED)
                                        → trySettle (cộng revenue + PAID)
  - try-catch quanh từng auction → 1 lỗi không chết scheduler.
  - Có thể chạy ĐỒNG THỜI placeBid của user
    → cả 2 đều mua Auction.lock, kẻ thua thấy state đã đổi
      và throw AuctionClosedException (đúng kỳ vọng).
end note
N_tick .. AuctionManager

note as N_lockorder
  **BidManager.placeBid()** — LOCK ORDER (ĐỪNG ĐẢO!):
    User.intrinsic  ─►  Auction.lock  ─►  User.intrinsic (prev leader)
        (reserve)         (entity)              (release)
  Hiện code KHÔNG mua 2 lock cùng lúc → không deadlock.
  Xem docs/lock-ordering.md để biết contract chi tiết.
end note
N_lockorder .. BidManager

@enduml
